+# XHIGH External Evidence Read-Only Integration
+
+## Scope
+
+This adapter exposes the frozen XHIGH `ee_*` external-evidence namespace to
+Perfume-Chem without creating a second canonical truth path.
+
+It does not write or promote target formulas, inventory events, bottles,
+physical batches, internal observations, analytical measurements, strict OAV,
+measured-headspace claims, or release state. No write-enablement setting exists.
+
+## Default-off behavior
+
+The route is not registered unless:
+
+```text
+PERFUME_CHEM_EXTERNAL_EVIDENCE_ENABLED=true
+```
+
+Application restart is required after changing the flag.
+
+## Sealed release directory
+
+Prepare one dedicated, immutable, non-symlink release directory containing
+exactly the deployment copies of:
+
+```text
+XHIGH_RELEASE_INDEX.json
+Perfume_Chem_External_Evidence_XHIGH_RELEASE_CANDIDATE.zip
+XHIGH_MODULE_MANIFEST.json
+XHIGH_EXTERNAL_EVIDENCE.sqlite
+```
+
+`data/external_evidence/XHIGH_RELEASE_INDEX.template.json` is the sealed-v2
+index for the canonical XHIGH release. Copy its bytes without editing them. Its
+current SHA-256 is:
+
+```text
+ccaa514c3dd369e732c814fb5b831208961506c40701eb913a2217fc8b99b411
+```
+
+Store that expected index hash in deployment configuration or a secret manager,
+not in the mutable release directory. The runtime hashes the index bytes and
+compares them with this external trust anchor **before parsing JSON**.
+
+Configure:
+
+```text
+PERFUME_CHEM_EXTERNAL_EVIDENCE_RELEASE_ID=XHIGH-RC-2026-08-08
+PERFUME_CHEM_EXTERNAL_EVIDENCE_RELEASE_ROOT=/absolute/non-symlink/release/root
+PERFUME_CHEM_EXTERNAL_EVIDENCE_RELEASE_INDEX=/absolute/non-symlink/release/root/XHIGH_RELEASE_INDEX.json
+PERFUME_CHEM_EXTERNAL_EVIDENCE_RELEASE_INDEX_SHA256=ccaa514c3dd369e732c814fb5b831208961506c40701eb913a2217fc8b99b411
+```
+
+Every artifact path in the index must be relative to the configured root.
+Absolute paths, `..` traversal, backslash ambiguity, and any symlink component
+are rejected.
+
+## Archive, manifest, and database closure
+
+Selection is not based on three unrelated hashes. The adapter verifies one
+sealed release object:
+
+1. external index SHA-256 against the separately configured trust anchor;
+2. external archive byte size and SHA-256;
+3. ZIP structural readability and CRC for every member;
+4. one declared archive member root, with no duplicate or escaping member name;
+5. the archive's `XHIGH_SHA256SUMS.json` ledger;
+6. exact ledger coverage of every archive file except the self-referential
+   ledger itself;
+7. byte size and SHA-256 for every ledger-covered member;
+8. exact manifest and database member hashes against the external manifest and
+   external SQLite files;
+9. manifest release ID, freeze state, timestamp, database member, and ledger
+   identity against the selected release;
+10. a second archive SHA-256 check after closure verification.
+
+The database is opened only after all checks pass. A self-consistent replacement
+index, a substituted database paired with the real archive, and an outside-root
+artifact all fail closed.
+
+## SQLite barriers
+
+The provider:
+
+- verifies database SHA-256 before every connection;
+- opens SQLite using URI `mode=ro&immutable=1`;
+- sets `PRAGMA query_only=ON`;
+- exposes only validated `ee_*` tables and views;
+- parameterizes all values;
+- rejects unsafe identifiers;
+- bounds every result set;
+- offers no write method.
+
+## GET-only API
+
+When enabled at startup:
+
+```text
+GET /api/v1/external-evidence/health
+GET /api/v1/external-evidence/objects
+GET /api/v1/external-evidence/records/{object_name}
+GET /api/v1/external-evidence/experiments
+```
+
+No POST, PATCH, PUT, or DELETE route exists.
+
+## Pre-start verification
+
+Run the exact same selector and database checks before starting the API:
+
+```text
+cd backend
+poetry run python scripts/verify_xhigh_release.py \
+  --release-root /absolute/non-symlink/release/root \
+  --index /absolute/non-symlink/release/root/XHIGH_RELEASE_INDEX.json \
+  --index-sha256 ccaa514c3dd369e732c814fb5b831208961506c40701eb913a2217fc8b99b411 \
+  --release-id XHIGH-RC-2026-08-08
+```
+
+The canonical release should report archive CRC verified, 31 archive members,
+30 ledger entries verified, SQLite `quick_check=ok`, zero foreign-key
+violations, 34 tables, and 2 views.
+
+## Qualification
+
+Run:
+
+```text
+cd backend
+poetry run ruff check \
+  app/external_evidence \
+  app/api/v1/endpoints/external_evidence.py \
+  app/api/v1/router.py \
+  app/core/config.py \
+  scripts/verify_xhigh_release.py \
+  tests/test_external_evidence_adapter.py \
+  tests/test_external_evidence_api.py \
+  tests/test_external_evidence_release_security.py
+
+poetry run pytest -q \
+  tests/test_external_evidence_adapter.py \
+  tests/test_external_evidence_api.py \
+  tests/test_external_evidence_release_security.py
+```
+
+The security suite must reject index replacement, database substitution,
+absolute-path escape, parent traversal, artifact/index/root symlinks, ledger
+mismatch or incomplete coverage, ZIP CRC corruption, duplicate members, members
+outside the declared archive root, and manifest identity mismatch. The remaining
+tests cover default-off behavior, stale ancestry,
+read-only SQLite, deterministic reads, query boundaries, mutation denial, host
+truth-table invariance, and GET-only routes.
+
+## Rollback
+
+Rollback is bounded:
+
+1. set the feature flag false and restart;
+2. remove the bounded child integration commit or close the child PR;
+3. leave the frozen external archive and database untouched;
+4. verify canonical host table hashes remain unchanged.
+
+No host schema migration is required by this adapter.
